# Normalize line endings. Without this, core.autocrlf=true lets git checkout
# write a source file with CRLF while a tool-written one keeps LF -- both clean
# to git -- and esbuild embeds those bytes verbatim into sourcemap
# sourcesContent, so the same commit builds different bytes in different
# checkouts. See docs/working/agent-git-workflow-plan.md.
* text=auto eol=lf
